12. PATCH urn:V3 ?local=true: speed=9000 → 409 (exclusive claims speed); color=red → 204 (unclaimed, local-only merge)
=======================================================================================================================
HTTP/1.1 409 Conflict
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: REGEX(\d+)

{
  "detail": "local update overlaps with registration 'urn:CSR:PatchBypass' (§ 9.3.3 — no local data for an exclusive/redirect scope)",
  "status": 409,
  "title": "Conflict",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/AlreadyExists"
}


HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
Date: REGEX(.*)




